# Design Tokens

## Guidance

- <a href="./?path=/docs/primary-foundations-tokens-how-to-use--docs" target="_top">How to use design tokens</a>
- <a href="./?path=/docs/primary-foundations-tokens-contributing--docs" target="_top">Contribute token changes</a>

## Downloads and useful links

- **Tokens:** {tokenCounts.total} &middot; **Colors:** {tokenCounts.color} &middot; **Format:** JSON
- <a href={githubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub</a>
- <a href="#" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); downloadJson(tokensDocument, 'tokens.json'); }}>Download raw JSON</a>
- <a href="#" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); downloadText(tokensCssRaw, 'tokens.css', 'text/css'); }}>Download tokens.css</a> · <a href={tokensCssGithubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View tokens.css on this branch</a>
- <a href="#" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); downloadText(tokensScssRaw, 'tokens.scss', 'text/x-scss'); }}>Download tokens.scss</a> · <a href={tokensScssGithubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View tokens.scss on this branch</a>
- <a href="#" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); downloadText(tokensVarsJsRaw, 'tokens.vars.js', 'text/javascript'); }}>Download tokens.vars.js</a> · <a href={tokensVarsJsGithubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View tokens.vars.js on this branch</a>
- <a href="#" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); downloadText(tokensVarsDtsRaw, 'tokens.vars.d.ts', 'text/plain'); }}>Download tokens.vars.d.ts</a> · <a href={tokensVarsDtsGithubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View tokens.vars.d.ts on this branch</a>
- <a href={specUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DTCG Color Format Spec</a>

Source file: `packages/tokens/tokens.json`

## Colors

Arizona's brand palette (`az.color.brand.*`), the raw color values every other color token is built from.

<ColorSwatchGrid prefix="az.color.brand." />

## Shared decisions

Decisions every component that needs them shares, so they change in one place. Each is named the way implementations already name the same decision: `az.focus-ring.width.md` is the focus ring's width wherever one is drawn.

<TokenDisplay items={getTokenDisplayItems('az.focus-ring.', { order: 'source' })} layout="table" />

## Components

Each component's contract (`packages/contracts`) sets each of its parts' design properties: colors point at color tokens for what they color and where (`az.color.bg.button.red`, `az.color.fg.white`), shared decisions at their shared token, and everything specific to the component, such as its sizes and timings, is a value in the contract itself, with a description of what it's for. Its docs page shows the contract as an Anatomy table.

